# Baird, Steward of Argive taxes attacks on "you or planeswalkers you control" (CR 508.1d, 508.1h): a battle its controller
# protects is neither (CR 310.9b), so attacking it costs nothing. Bot1 casts Invasion of Gobakhan, which Bot2 protects, and
# on turn 3 attacks it with one Llanowar Elves and Bot2 with the other: the total is {1}, for the Elf attacking Bot2 alone,
# paid with Mox Ruby; Mox Sapphire stays untapped. The Siege goes from 3 defense to 2, and Bot2 to 19.

